If the Fishing Creation is installed, there are 7 exterior fishing locations in the Eastmarch hold:
 2 Freezing locations: on The North Wind in Windhelm , and on the southern pier in Windhelm ;
 1 Lake location: on the pier at Stony Creek Cave ;
 and 4 Stream locations, following the river north to south: at the base of the river waterfall northwest of Kynesgrove , next to Riverside Shack , next to Mixwater Mill , and at Darkwater Crossing next to the four tents by the river .
 There is also 1 Underground (interior) location: in Lost Knife Cave .

If the Fishing Creation is installed, there are 9 exterior fishing locations in The Rift hold:
 1 Freezing location: near Fort Dawnguard ;
 2 Stream locations: on the southwest side of Vilemyr Inn in Ivarstead , on the lower level between the market at Riften Grand Plaza and Marise Aravel's House ;
 and 6 Lake locations: east of Geirmund's Hall , east of Heartwood Mill , on the pier east of Faldar's Tooth , and in Riften on the west docks of the Riften Fishery , outside Black-Briar Meadery , and outside Honeyside if you have upgraded the porch .
 There is also 1 Underground (interior) location: in Dead Drop Falls .

