Crossbows are only available with the Dawnguard add-on. The Dwarven Crossbow can only be acquired by siding with the Dawnguard (see Ancient Technology for details). The Elven and Ebony Crossbows require the completion of the quest Night Hunter, while other types of Crossbows can be purchased from the Fletcher in Solitude. Crossbows all require bolts as ammunition instead of arrows. While all other types of crossbows and all bolts can be manufactured at any forge, regular and Dwarven Crossbows can only be crafted at Gunmar's forge in Fort Dawnguard or at the All Forge in the Myrwatch Creation. Forging Elven and Ebony Crossbows requires the completion of the quest Night Hunter, and other crossbows will need to be acquired from loot or merchants first before they can be crafted. Crafting Stalhrim Crossbows also requires the completion of A New Source of Stalhrim. 

