The Three Queens is the Solstice Corelanyan Altmer term for their three Daedric patrons: Azura, Meridia, and Nocturnal.

The Cathedral of the Three Queens is located in the Solstice city of Sunport, and includes places of worship for the Three Queens and other Divines.

Meridia is known as the Queen of the Light and Day, she grants mortals potential for perfection and guides the Corelanya altmer to Alaxon;
Azura, Queen of Dawn and Dusk, helps and protects mortals during life's vicissitudes and transitions;
Nocturnal, Queen of Darkness and the Evening, judges and helps mortals at the end of their life.

